 "android-data-display|List": {
  "summary": "A Plenix list on Android is a LazyColumn of Material 3 ListItem rows, kept native in behavior (ripple, row semantics for TalkBack, font scale) and styled with the Plenix tokens: rows at least 48 dp tall on the default surface, DM Sans text at the body and secondary roles, a 20 dp leading icon in its tone, 1 dp divider lines and the Plenix pressed and selected fills. Material’s default is a 56 dp row in the surface color with Roboto text; Plenix keeps Material’s structure and replaces the look.",
